    "detailed_description": "<h1>FEATURES</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/fd275c9058a61c24f88fd64a08ad9e07.avif?t=1700085894\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Two hands card battle system.<br></li><li> Your deck is built from highly customizable plants upgradable through artificial selection and hybridization.<br></li><li> 4 unlockable characters with different recurrent action cards.<br></li><li> 5 different tribes to conquer, each with their own unique boss.<br></li><li> Open map, travel anywhere you want on the island.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/759bf172783c3db12b7b885c09d6a943.avif?t=1700085894\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/d95c4aa3258e4204929555a052cd18ee.poster.avif?t=1700085894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/d95c4aa3258e4204929555a052cd18ee.webm?t=1700085894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Botanical Warden is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder in which plants are used to fight strategic challenging turn-based combat. Evolve your plants with artificial selection and hybridization to create endless possibilities in your quest to defeat other tribes and conquer a barren island.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/7fe5c717333a69cb340b497de5001134.webp?t=1700085894\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/9f43afa494e4977bf78fc32866bd9bd8.poster.avif?t=1700085894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/9f43afa494e4977bf78fc32866bd9bd8.webm?t=1700085894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Two hands battle system, one is your plants randomly drawn from your deck and the other is recurring actions based on your character and your battle choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/7fe5c717333a69cb340b497de5001134.webp?t=1700085894\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/21c53b3c43ea347cbf485dea42e29f72.poster.avif?t=1700085894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/21c53b3c43ea347cbf485dea42e29f72.webm?t=1700085894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br>Turn-based, strategic combat in Botanical Warden is designed with player choices in mind. Choices on how your upgrade your deck and how you play out the battle define your success with limited RNG impact.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/7fe5c717333a69cb340b497de5001134.webp?t=1700085894\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/2add62c48c7ceaec0927eea3c01c12ed.poster.avif?t=1700085894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470930/extras/2add62c48c7ceaec0927eea3c01c12ed.webm?t=1700085894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br>Open map where you decide in each run which of the 5 bosses you want to fight. Your path on the map is unrestricted and you can explore the island freely.",
